 'Synthetic session established. Open Customer Booking in this browser. Account and delivery verification are still required.':'模拟会话已建立。请在此浏览器打开客户预约，仍须验证账户及报告接收方式。',
 'Account OTP request ID: ':'账户验证码请求编号：'
